  "title": "iSpot, NCM partnership",
  "summary": "National CineMedia, the largest cinema advertising platform in the US, and cross‑platform TV ad measurement company iSpot, have announced the companies are deepening their partnership – with independent, in‑cinema measurement of advertisements that appear in the trailers before movies begin. The deal marks NCM’s first integration of advertising information with a third‑party measurement provider…",
